\* All TLC check configs for AntflyHAGates.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
\* TLC config for AntflyHAGates.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStandbyBackgroundRuntime = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    ProgressOrdered
    FailClosedDoesNotAppendAck
    StandbyReadNeverBeyondSafeOrMetadata
    FencedPrimaryCannotWrite
    OwnerJobsRequireWritablePrimary
    MutatingBackgroundRequiresWritablePrimary
    StandbyDoesNotRunMutatingBackground
    Safety

==== BadStandbyRuntime
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyHAGates.tla.
\* Enables a mutant that starts mutating optional/background runtimes on a
\* standby DB role.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStandbyBackgroundRuntime = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    ProgressOrdered
    FailClosedDoesNotAppendAck
    StandbyReadNeverBeyondSafeOrMetadata
    FencedPrimaryCannotWrite
    OwnerJobsRequireWritablePrimary
    MutatingBackgroundRequiresWritablePrimary
    StandbyDoesNotRunMutatingBackground
    Safety
